"Price\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Price</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">$21,000</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Version Added\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Pre-release</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">?</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span></h2>\n<p><b>Refined Pickaxe</b> is a pickaxe that is sold at <a href=\"/wiki/The_Oak_Depot\" title=\"The Oak Depot\">The Oak Depot</a>. It can be bought for $21,000. It's one of the best pickaxes a player can buy.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Appearance\">Appearance</span></h2>\n<p><b>Refined Pickaxe</b> is a tall pick that seems to be made out of refined steel and wood. It's headpiece is made out of refined steel; using the default legacy metal material as it's coating. It's handle is made out of wood, painted blue, having a thick rubber grip for maximum efficiency and accurate hits; using the default legacy sand material as it's coating.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span></h2>\n<ul><li>Due to an error in stats displayed in it's description, it was wrongly assumed, that it's stats are the same as <a href=\"/wiki/Tall_Steel_Pickaxe\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Tall Steel Pickaxe\">Tall Steel Pickaxe</a>. This mistake was corrected with the release of new UI.</li>\n<li>It's axe counterpart is <a href=\"/wiki/Tall_Refined_Axe\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Tall Refined Axe\">Refined Axe</a>. Despite being in the same \"series\", <b>Refined Axe</b> has a greater significance than it's pickaxe counterpart.</li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260903105726\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.039 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.050 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 82/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 52/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 11/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.006/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1019515/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   42.159      1 Template:Pickaxe\n100.00%   42.159      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_oaklands:pcache:idhash:290-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260903105726 and revision id 12916. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>","categories":["Tools","Pickaxes"],"links":[{"title":"The Oak Depot","exists":true},{"title":"Tall Refined Axe","exists":true},{"title":"Tall Steel Pickaxe","exists":true}],"images":["UnboxedTallRefinedPickaxe.png","TallRefinedPickaxe.png"]}
